<div class="offer-panel"><h2>The offer ladder</h2>
<p class="offer-sub">Your maximum offer at four investor discounts on the same property. Tighter discounts suit slow markets and heavy rehabs; looser ones suit hot markets and light work.</p>
<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0"><table class="offer-table"><thead><tr><th>Investor discount</th><th>Buyer's price</th><th>Your max offer</th></tr></thead><tbody id="ladder-body"></tbody></table></div>
</div>
